<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 26.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 26.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   97/99     97/99    UNQ     163/166</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  98/100   101/104  168/173  178/183</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker quotes were softer amid the weak cargo market on Thursday, traders said. Suppliers raised their offers earlier in the day after recent healthy enquiries but cut their offers later by $1/$2 per tonne over falls in the cargo market, traders said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
